Package: anvil-control
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Tubix777 <Tubix777@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: pciutils
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Desktop hardware monitor for Linux
 Anvil Control displays available sensor readings, fan speeds, GPU telemetry,
 and hardware inventory in a Qt desktop application.
 This Debian-family package starts in monitoring-only mode. It includes no
 privileged helper and changes no fan, power-profile, RGB or kernel settings.
